export anchor Border:
    description:
        Shorthand that sets the width, style and colour of all four borders at once. Any part left out is reset to its initial value, except that a border given a style but no width is 1px wide, since Emul has no width keywords.

    identifier: border

    cssProperty:
        Corresponds to the CSS `border` property.

    values:
        - `none`
        - `<border-width>? <border-style> <border-color>?`

    initial: none

    appliesTo: All components.

    example:
        ```emul
        \\\
        component Example:
            border: 1px solid #d4d4d8
        \\\
        ```
